+- `async-client` | Red Cup Engineering | approved private cache contract 2026-10-24 | ./issuer-private-sqlite-cache.work-order.md | Mandatory complete additional named async interfaces; independently qualified I/O, not JSON preassay. | The market module exports createIssuerEvidenceReadStore(namespace,configuration). If admission plan is null, return undefined. Otherwise require namespace.idFromName/get functions or throw TypeError. Return an object with async get(key). Reject any key not exactly configured cacheKey with TypeError before namespace or stub calls. For allowed get, resolve namespace.idFromName('earning-loops'), namespace.get(id), then stub.fetch one new Request using https://issuer-cache.invalid/issuer-evidence with exactly URLSearchParams key=cacheKey; methodGET, redirect:manual, never follow redirects and reject every non200 response except missing404. No public origin fetch. HTTP404 returns null; any other non200 result or thrown failure throws an Error with code issuer-revenue-unavailable,status503,retryable:true and no responsebody/error disclosure. A successful response must have body a ReadableStream and Content-Length a canonical nonnegative safe integer no greater than maximumCohortBytes; invalid/missing/overflow length refuses and cancels body when possible. Return exactly {body:response.body,size:length}. Never consume, parse, modify or cache the stream, never acquire sources or mutate storage/alarms.
+- `async-integration` | Red Cup Engineering | approved private cache contract 2026-10-24 | ./issuer-private-sqlite-cache.work-order.md | Mandatory complete additional named async interfaces; independently qualified I/O, not JSON preassay. | Source-free unit produces src/issuer-sqlite-cache.mjs and src/issuer-evidence-store.mjs only plus native schema/test projections. Their final actual owners are earning-loop-worker-service/src/issuer-sqlite-cache.mjs and market.561.group/src/issuer-evidence-store.mjs respectively; the second exact proposal is received at that owning consumer without a new package or private worker dependency. No cross-module import is needed. Additional async exports above are mandatory full implementations. Source imports no external package, filesystem, process or env. Pure default operation examples qualify only pureplans; additional I/O requires independent realworkerd receiving. Ordinary integration changes existing refreshIssuerResearch to consume the supplied issuerStore and removes every issuer STATE fallback; EarningClock wraps existing refresh in withIssuerSqliteStore on same serialized queue and calls private handler before alarm arming. Existing run/tick, OpenTask state/custody/alarms, public routes and other maintenance remain intact. Market binds existing external namespace/class/script and same singleton; it injects readStore only, never refresh. No new namespace/migration/schedule/public cache route.
+- `async-status` | Red Cup Engineering | independent receiving correction 2026-10-24 | ./issuer-private-sqlite-cache.work-order.md | Minimal actual existing coordinator record validation; no new retry policy or authority. | Both physical wrappers have cacheKey exactly configuration.cacheKey, including the status wrapper; get(logicalStatusKey) maps to physical statusKey and compares that configured cohort identity. Stored status JSON must be a nonnull nonarray object with cacheKey exactly configuration.cacheKey and status exactly prepared or unavailable. For normal records at must be a canonical UTC ISO millisecond instant; prepared observedAt is canonical instant or null, nextAttemptAt a canonical instant no earlier than at, retryBlocked absent or false. Normal unavailable has error string, code/reason each string or null, retryable boolean, retryAfter string or null and retryBlocked boolean; if blocked, nextAttemptAt must be null; otherwise nextAttemptAt is canonical instant no earlier than at. Additional normal status fields may be retained unchanged. The only special record is the exact minimal status-overflow sentinel already specified, accepted with retryBlocked true and nextAttemptAt null without at/error fields. Reject corrupt stored null/array/number, nonboolean retryBlocked, missing/malformed/contradictory deadlines and wrong cache identity before calling work or producer. Invalid staged status shape throws so the complete transaction rolls back; syntactically unrepresentable or oversized status uses the specified minimal overflow sentinel. Do not reinterpret retryable or recalculate Retry-After: the original coordinator owns policy.
